## P-008 PATCH PACKET — CONNECTOR UNIFICATION LAYER (FINAL EXECUTION MODEL)

### Patch ID

**P-008-CONNECTOR-UNIFICATION-LAYER**

---

# 1. OBJECTIVE

Collapse all external execution complexity into a **single deterministic connector plane**:

* Supabase writes
* GitHub commits
* MCP tool execution
* future external integrations

All become:

> ONE routing surface, ONE execution contract, ONE trace model

---

# 2. CORE PROBLEM BEING SOLVED

Current system issues:

* multiple indirect execution paths (SKADI, ODIN, MCP divergence)
* duplicate routing logic
* inconsistent trace propagation
* connector intelligence leaking into execution layer
* fragmented Supabase vs GitHub write semantics

---

# 3. NEW ARCHITECTURE: CONNECTOR UNIFICATION PLANE

## Introduce: CONNECTOR CORE (logical layer inside MCP boundary)

```text
JARVIS
  ↓
GOD SYSTEMS (evaluation only)
  ↓
FINAL ACTION PACKET
  ↓
CONNECTOR CORE (P-008)
  ↓
Supabase / GitHub / MCP Tools
```

---

# 4. CONNECTOR CORE SPEC

## Single interface

```ts id="g0w2e3"
type unified_connector_request = {
  trace_id: string

  target: "supabase" | "github" | "mcp"

  operation: "insert" | "update" | "delete" | "commit" | "invoke"

  resource: string

  payload: Record<string, any>

  metadata: {
    source: "JARVIS" | "SKADI" | "AYRE"
    intent: string
    governance_flags: string[]
  }

  timestamp: string
}
```

---

# 5. CONNECTOR CORE RULES

## Rule A — NO DIRECT EXECUTION OUTSIDE CONNECTOR CORE

* SKADI cannot write directly
* ODIN cannot route directly
* MCP tools cannot bypass connector core

---

## Rule B — SINGLE WRITE PATH

```text
ALL WRITES MUST PASS THROUGH:
CONNECTOR CORE ONLY
```

No exceptions.

---

## Rule C — TRACE IS MANDATORY

Every request MUST include:

* `trace_id`
* `intent`
* `target`
* `operation`

Missing any → reject.

---

# 6. SUPABASE UNIFICATION

All tables become sink targets:

| Target          | Behavior             |
| --------------- | -------------------- |
| mnemos_memories | semantic insert      |
| event_spine     | chronological insert |
| execution_trace | system log           |
| decision_ledger | governance decisions |
| patch_proposals | structural changes   |

Connector does NOT interpret meaning — only routes by target.

---

# 7. GITHUB UNIFICATION

GitHub becomes a **structured event sink**, not a side system.

## GitHub operations:

* commit → structured patch packet
* PR → patch proposal sink
* sync → repository state event

---

# 8. MCP ROLE REDUCTION

MCP is now:

> dumb transport executor only

It:

* receives unified_connector_request
* executes
* returns result
* emits trace

It does NOT:

* route
* decide
* validate business logic

---

