## BEFORE

* ODIN routes execution
* SKADI executes
* AEGIS validates
* MCP executes

## AFTER P-008

| System         | Role                    |
| -------------- | ----------------------- |
| ODIN           | advisory routing only   |
| AEGIS          | pre-flight evaluation   |
| SKADI          | simulation + validation |
| CONNECTOR CORE | execution authority     |

